// Key shape (same as the general resource test, different lifecycle):
//   - plan/state are built via tfsdk.Plan / tfsdk.State carrying the schema,
//     populated from the MODEL struct;
//   - a config resource has NO create API: Create and Update share ONE apply
//     path (write API, then read back), Delete is a no-op, and the state id
